<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">About ToolboxKart</span><h1>Useful tools should explain themselves.</h1><p>ToolboxKart is a multi-category utility library designed around clear interfaces, transparent calculations and practical supporting content.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container" style="max-width:820px"><div class="tool-content"><h2>What we are building</h2><p>Instead of limiting one website to a single niche, ToolboxKart brings focused utilities for SEO, marketing, finance, healthcare revenue-cycle operations, developers and productivity into one consistent experience.</p><h2>Our product principles</h2><p>Put the working tool first. Explain formulas and assumptions. Avoid fake precision. Process data locally when practical. Keep category-specific safety boundaries. Preserve one shared design system as the library grows.</p><h2>Editorial attribution</h2><p>ToolboxKart blog articles in this launch release are written by Deepak Parmar. Tool pages combine functional utilities with original explanatory content intended to help users understand the output.</p></div></div></section><?php require __DIR__.'/includes/footer.php';?>
